      "message": "Could you re-use the existing `sshSession.requiresGracefulStop()` instead of adding this new method? Though maybe the intent there is too different. We probably want to wait for a user query to finish during a graceful shutdown, but we can cancel it immediately if the client disconnects.",
      "revId": "35fdf2c04762406d4a1cd9e2ed91c74d9e3cc4cf",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
